=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  logforward refuse-alpine-tcp ---------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Decided: no Figma frame. alpine-tcp's Set servers: refused$
# with words.$
$
  Checking the host...$
$
# Warning$
# busybox syslogd forwards over UDP only. Set protocol: udp for$
# 192.0.2.50 in hardn.yml, then try again.$
$
# Syslog Settings ##############################################$
$
  [ ] Syslog               Review ~ not forwarding$
$
  Forwarding ---------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Logger               busybox syslogd$
   -  Server               None$
   -  hardn.yml            192.0.2.50:514 TCP$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Set servers          busybox syslogd is UDP only$
   2) Refresh              Read the host again$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-2 or q]: $
$
$

